abstract: >-
  Blind reference-differential binding oracle for Linux livepatch modules (frozen
  versions through v1.7 with an AArch64 extension, including rules RF and RS), the fault operators that edit
  built modules, the selection and build scripts for a corpus of 150 CVE fixes on
  stable kernels, the loader, presence-test and generator-comparison runners, and
  every run record behind the reported results.
keywords:
  - livepatch
  - test oracle
  - mutation analysis
  - Linux kernel
